TEST FIXTURES ONLY. A throwaway CA and a server certificate for
`localhost`, with its private key, used by the in-process fake FTPS server
in ../ftp.rs's tests. The key guards nothing and is only ever loaded under
cfg(test). Generated with openssl (EC P-256, valid 100 years): ca.pem is
CA:TRUE pathlen 0; server.pem is CA:FALSE, serverAuth, SAN DNS:localhost only.
